        "view": "array",
        "code": "def binary_search(a, target):\n    low, high = 0, len(a) - 1\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if a[mid] == target: return mid\n        if a[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n    return -1",
